    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακινδῡν-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run all risks, make a desperate attempt,</i> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλόγως δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς Ἐπιπολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ὀλίγας [ναῦς]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.142
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑπὲρ τῆς Ἑλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					2.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸ βασιλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.8.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῶν ὅλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3.12
				</span></i>
			 (simply, <i>run the risk,</i> c. acc. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἢ χρηστὸν [τὸ σῶμα] γενέσθαι ἢ
					πονηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					313a
				</span></i>
			):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακεκινδυνευμένα φάρμακα</span>
